a</a> defeats <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bijapur">Bijapur</a> at the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-raichur">Battle of Raichur</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1565</span><span class="rf-text">The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/deccan-sultanates">Deccan sultanates</a> defeat Vijayanagara at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-talikota">Talikota</a> and sack the capital</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">c. 1570</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/tirumala-deva-raya">Tirumala</a> founds the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/aravidu-dynasty">Aravidu dynasty</a> at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/penukonda">Penukonda</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">c. 1646</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sriranga-iii">Sriranga III</a> loses his last territories to <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bijapur">Bijapur</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/golconda-fort">Golconda</a></span></li></ol>
